00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:08.500
PATRICIA WALSH: So what we're
here today to talk to you about

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.410
is how we're working to
transform Dow Jones into a data

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.610
business.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.910
So the data engineering team,
which Dylan was manager of,

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.930
we had the opportunity
